@host = http://localhost:3000
@proxySecret = {{$dotenv PROXY_SECRET}}

### Health (público, sin auth ni proxy secret)
GET {{host}}/health

### Sign In
POST {{host}}/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json
X-Proxy-Secret: {{proxySecret}}

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "newpassword1234"
}

### Current User (Me)
GET {{host}}/me
X-Proxy-Secret: {{proxySecret}}

### Sign Out
POST {{host}}/auth/sign-out
X-Proxy-Secret: {{proxySecret}}

### Tiendas (q opcional)
GET {{host}}/stores?q=exito
X-Proxy-Secret: {{proxySecret}}

### Editar tienda
PATCH {{host}}/stores/REEMPLAZAR-STORE-ID
Content-Type: application/json
X-Proxy-Secret: {{proxySecret}}

{
  "type": "cadena",
  "nit": "900123456-1"
}

### Subir factura (1 o 2 fotos en "images"; storeId o storeName + storeType)
POST {{host}}/receipts
X-Proxy-Secret: {{proxySecret}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=factura

--factura
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="storeName"

Éxito
--factura
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="storeType"

cadena
--factura
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="factura.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./factura.jpg
--factura--

### Reintentar fotos (solo si la factura quedó unreadable)
PUT {{host}}/receipts/REEMPLAZAR-RECEIPT-ID/images
X-Proxy-Secret: {{proxySecret}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=factura

--factura
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="factura.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./factura.jpg
--factura--

### URLs firmadas (5 min) de las fotos
GET {{host}}/receipts/REEMPLAZAR-RECEIPT-ID/images
X-Proxy-Secret: {{proxySecret}}


### Facturas (filtros opcionales: storeType, storeId, from, to, q, category, page, limit)
GET {{host}}/receipts?storeType=cadena&from=2026-01-01&page=1&limit=20
X-Proxy-Secret: {{proxySecret}}

### Ver factura con tienda, fotos e ítems
GET {{host}}/receipts/REEMPLAZAR-RECEIPT-ID
X-Proxy-Secret: {{proxySecret}}

### Editar factura (solo fecha y total, en draft)
PATCH {{host}}/receipts/REEMPLAZAR-RECEIPT-ID
Content-Type: application/json
X-Proxy-Secret: {{proxySecret}}

{
  "purchasedAt": "2026-11-15",
  "total": 29100
}

### Corregir y/o confirmar un ítem (productId o product, no ambos)
PATCH {{host}}/receipts/REEMPLAZAR-RECEIPT-ID/items/REEMPLAZAR-ITEM-ID
Content-Type: application/json
X-Proxy-Secret: {{proxySecret}}

{
  "confirmed": true
}

### Confirmar factura (422 si falta confirmar algún ítem, producto, fecha o total)
POST {{host}}/receipts/REEMPLAZAR-RECEIPT-ID/confirm
X-Proxy-Secret: {{proxySecret}}

### Reabrir factura confirmada (vuelve a draft y desmarca los ítems)
POST {{host}}/receipts/REEMPLAZAR-RECEIPT-ID/reopen
X-Proxy-Secret: {{proxySecret}}

### Registrar a mano (solo si quedó unreadable)
POST {{host}}/receipts/REEMPLAZAR-RECEIPT-ID/manual
X-Proxy-Secret: {{proxySecret}}

### Agregar ítem a mano (solo entry_mode manual; line_total lo calcula el servidor)
POST {{host}}/receipts/REEMPLAZAR-RECEIPT-ID/items
Content-Type: application/json
X-Proxy-Secret: {{proxySecret}}

{
  "description": "Carne molida",
  "quantity": 1.25,
  "unit": "kg",
  "unitPrice": 20000,
  "product": { "name": "Carne molida", "category": "Carnes", "baseUnit": "g", "baseSize": 1 }
}

### Borrar factura (solo draft o unreadable)
DELETE {{host}}/receipts/REEMPLAZAR-RECEIPT-ID
X-Proxy-Secret: {{proxySecret}}

### Productos (q opcional)
GET {{host}}/products?q=leche
X-Proxy-Secret: {{proxySecret}}

### Editar producto
PATCH {{host}}/products/REEMPLAZAR-PRODUCT-ID
Content-Type: application/json
X-Proxy-Secret: {{proxySecret}}

{
  "category": "Lácteos",
  "baseSize": 1100
}
